{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want","id":987283,"title":"If You Could Get Any Book or Section in WtF, What Would You Want?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-14T09:01:51-07:00","id":987283,"title":"If You Could Get Any Book or Section in WtF, What Would You Want?","content":"Just like the title suggests. If you had your choice of whatever sort of new 2nd Edition book or content in a book you could want, what would you ask Onyx Path Publishing for? What would you like to see expanded on and added to the publishing roster? <br /> <br /> I personally really want tribe books once more. But perhaps even more, once the ground work is set, I'd love to have a 'What If' volume. Something exploring alternate possibilities somewhat like a 'Mirrors' book focused on WtF. What if other tribes were in place than the current ones? What if the Pure were the ones trying to keep balance and the Forsaken were the ones who couldn't give a damn? Or what if they had found some modicum of large-scale peace in the face of darker dangers? What if the Idigram had more werewolves than just the Bale Hounds at their beck and call? What if Pangea still existed? What about those strange, outlier auspices in 1e? Or, what if Helios was the Urathas' patron, rather than Luna?<br /> <br /> Another thing I'd love is an examination of the Hisil and ancient Pangea. What sort of creatures/spirits are there? How far can it truly reach out away from the Earth? Are there any pangeans left? <br /> <br /> And finally... Books of options. I know this sounds weird, but I love the books that give us lots of extra options and ways to fill out a setting. Something that adds more wolf-Blooded tells, or some more Lodge books. <br /> <br /> So, what would you guys like to see?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7621-threadwrought","name":"Threadwrought","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:38:46-07:00","id":987311,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see like a Blasphemies 2.0. Give me some rules for Bale Hounds and Wound spirits, please! Even if it's just a chapter in another book, like we got for playing Pure. It just seems like the biggest gap in terms of what's been brought over to 2e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T10:03:38-07:00","id":987317,"title":"","content":"I too would like a Blasphemies 2.0. Maeljin, Wound-tainted spirits and Bale Hounds have likely changed a lot since then, but the first couple chapters could, like the original, portray certain other blasphemies among the Uratha. Remnants of the Pangaean Cull or Tyrants, or the Maw who seek to grow powerful by eating all other werewolves. We could also see strange lodges like the Lodge of Humanity, who believe they serve the last or only spirit of humanity and in turn are protected from their death rages.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, yes I would like more on Pangaeans. I would find it hard to justify, because for the most part they seem to be dead and have little impact on play isn't seven thousand years ago. Perhaps it could fit into something else people, including myself, want. An 'end game' book.<br /> <br /> But really, Blasphemies 2.0 would get more use from me than an end game book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T13:20:51-07:00","id":987400,"title":"","content":"I'll third that request for updated Bale Hound and Maeljin info.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T13:25:54-07:00","id":987405,"title":"","content":"Just show me those predator bodhisattvas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T13:38:32-07:00","id":987413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987405#post987405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just show me those predator bodhisattvas.</div> </div> </div> </div>You'll want to pay attention to my actual play then :P<br /> <br /> \u200b(No, nothing official or the like, just some of my own initial thoughts and ideas are likely to be depicted in the next story arc of my Hong Kong game).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T13:50:42-07:00","id":987419,"title":"","content":"I want a proper Changing Breeds (maybe rolled together with a Skinchangers update).<br /> <br /> Yeah, there were a lot of problems with CB, but it had a neat concept, and there were some cool ideas there.<br /> <br /> Yeah, they were technically bluebooks, but everything about them screamed &quot;Werewolf Supplement&quot; to me, especially since Fera rules were also printed in War Against the Pure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T14:47:28-07:00","id":987451,"title":"","content":"A section on werewolves in Ancient Sumer (unless that was already taken care of in Dark Eras). The Shadow in the time of the dinosaurs. Something like the Aetherial Realm for spirits, and maybe ideas for shapeshifters that take totems from other planets, like Jupiter. That last one is probably a bit out there, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T15:40:48-07:00","id":987470,"title":"","content":"I would throw money at a book that was &quot;gift, rites and lodges&quot; that grabbed all the gift, rites and lodges from 1st and update to 2nd.<br /> <br /> Just that, no fluff, barely any art or fiction. Just delicious crunchy mechanics and nothing else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T15:45:39-07:00","id":987471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987451#post987451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A section on werewolves in Ancient Sumer (unless that was already taken care of in Dark Eras). The Shadow in the time of the dinosaurs. Something like the Aetherial Realm for spirits, and maybe ideas for shapeshifters that take totems from other planets, like Jupiter. That last one is probably a bit out there, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno. I was honestly curious about that. What happens to a wolf-Blooded that first changes in a place without traditional Auspices looking over them? Say... A space station? Or actually, Luna forbid, landed on the moon? I know it's a bit silly, considering all the obviously dangerous and technical issues, but it's being curious about the outliers that gets new ideas churning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7621-threadwrought","name":"Threadwrought","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T15:58:17-07:00","id":987477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiRavenSpeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987470#post987470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would throw money at a book that was &quot;gift, rites and lodges&quot; that grabbed all the gift, rites and lodges from 1st and update to 2nd.<br /> <br /> Just that, no fluff, barely any art or fiction. Just delicious crunchy mechanics and nothing else.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't think of a book I would want less, nor a book I can think Onyx Path would be less likely to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T16:04:05-07:00","id":987481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987477#post987477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can't think of a book I would want less, nor a book I can think Onyx Path would be less likely to do.</div> </div> </div> </div>First a man can dream, dream of delicious crunchy mechanics.<br /> <br /> And second they released Armory reloaded which was basically mostly crunchy mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T17:15:01-07:00","id":987499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiRavenSpeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987481#post987481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> First a man can dream, dream of delicious crunchy mechanics.<br /> <br /> And second they released Armory reloaded which was basically mostly crunchy mechanics.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't mind that. I would love to see updated stuff for at least Lodges. Likely gifts, too. And this thread isn't about likelihood, but what you'd like if there were no limits. ^_^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7621-threadwrought","user":"Threadwrought","date":".  Added an emote to help denote the intended tone. 10-14-2016, 08:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7621-threadwrought","name":"Threadwrought","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T17:30:12-07:00","id":987507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiRavenSpeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987481#post987481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And second they released Armory reloaded which was basically mostly crunchy mechanics.</div> </div> </div> </div>That wasn't Onyx Path, though. And Onyx Path has gone out of their way to express that Hurt Locker is unequivocally <i>not</i> Armory 2e. It's just not the kind of book Onyx Path produces. I mean, at least half of their employees have expressed publicly that they don't view game content in terms of &quot;fluff&quot; and &quot;crunch&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T18:12:36-07:00","id":987522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987507#post987507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That wasn't Onyx Path, though. And Onyx Path has gone out of their way to express that Hurt Locker is unequivocally <i>not</i> Armory 2e. It's just not the kind of book Onyx Path produces. I mean, at least half of their employees have expressed publicly that they don't view game content in terms of &amp;quot;fluff&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;crunch&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kind like hurt locker because they release a crunchy document with all the rules in it. Saves me the trouble to read through the fluff. :3","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T16:34:42-07:00","id":987997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987405#post987405\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just show me those predator bodhisattvas.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I want a book on too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987413#post987413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You'll want to pay attention to my actual play then :P<br /> <br /> \u200b(No, nothing official or the like, just some of my own initial thoughts and ideas are likely to be depicted in the next story arc of my Hong Kong game).</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool, I'm looking forward to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/477-xenorath","name":"Xenorath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"169"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T17:59:26-07:00","id":988024,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiRavenSpeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=987522#post987522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I kind like hurt locker because they release a crunchy document with all the rules in it. Saves me the trouble to read through the fluff. :3</div> </div> </div> </div>Dunno if youve ever checked out MYFAROG but its pretty much all crunch. Yes theres lore and world history but its very much part of the crunch. I suppose think AD&amp;D and there you go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T19:20:34-07:00","id":988060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lyrics Of War</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=988024#post988024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dunno if youve ever checked out MYFAROG but its pretty much all crunch. Yes theres lore and world history but its very much part of the crunch. I suppose think AD&amp;D and there you go.</div> </div> </div> </div>So me not liking an excessive amount of fluff means that i must hate all fluff? Im not against fluff but as we switched editions and we wait for conversions from the 1st ed gifts, rites and lodges and we talking about the books we want. I would really want they just get on with it and release all the conversions in one go.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","user":"LokiRavenSpeak","date":". 10-15-2016, 10:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T08:26:54-07:00","id":988256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LokiRavenSpeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/987283-if-you-could-get-any-book-or-section-in-wtf-what-would-you-want?p=988060#post988060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So me not liking an excessive amount of fluff means that i must hate all fluff? Im not against fluff but as we switched editions and we wait for conversions from the 1st ed gifts, rites and lodges and we talking about the books we want. I would really want they just get on with it and release all the conversions in one go.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're inferring something I didn't say. All I said was myfarog basically describes what you want in a book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyr